 PARAMETER G(FCC_A1,FE:C,VA;0)   298.15  -34671;              6000.00 N !

 PHASE CEMENTITE %  2  3.0  1.0 !
 CONSTITUENT CEMENTITE : FE : C : !
 PARAMETER G(CEMENTITE,FE:C;0)  298.15
    -10745+706.04*T-120.6*T*LN(T);                            6000.00 N !

 PHASE GRAPHITE %  1  1.0 !
 CONSTITUENT GRAPHITE : C : !
 PARAMETER G(GRAPHITE,C;0)  298.15  +GHSERCC#;                6000.00 N !

$ ---------- FeO-MgO-SiO2 slag (uTDB :Q extension + plain TDB) ----------
$ Same open assessment as web/FeO-MgO-SiO2-combined.dat; per-pair Gibbs on the
$ (1, T, T lnT, T^2, T^3, 1/T) basis, per mole of oxide formula.

